{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23371","headline":"荅崔宾客晦叔十二月四日见寄 · 白居易","name":"荅崔宾客晦叔十二月四日见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今岁日余二十六，来岁年登六十二。\n尚不能忧眼下身，因何更算人间事。\n居士忘筌默默坐，先生枕麴昏昏睡。\n早晚相从归醉乡，醉乡去此无多地。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}